{"title": "Mirrored (Condition)", "pageid": 31744, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Mirrored_(Condition)", "categories": ["Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Illusory_Self_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Illusory_Self_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Illusory_Self_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Illusory_Self_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Illusory_Self_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Illusory_Self_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Illusory Self Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Illusory_Self_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Illusory_Self_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/1e/Illusory_Self_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Mirrored</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Defeat your Reflection to complete Shar's trial. Attacking another player's Reflection will incur Shar's Wrath! </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">SHA_TORTURETRIAL_DOUBLE_OWNER</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:SHA_TORTURETRIAL_DOUBLE_OWNER+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:SHA_TORTURETRIAL_DOUBLE_OWNER+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\">Grants:</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Shar%27s_Rules\" title=\"Shar's Rules\">Shar's Rules</a></dt><dd>Damaging a Reflection that is not your own causes <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shar\" title=\"Shar\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Shar_Icon_Original.png/25px-Shar_Icon_Original.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Shar_Icon_Original.png/38px-Shar_Icon_Original.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Shar_Icon_Original.png/50px-Shar_Icon_Original.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shar\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Shar_Icon_Original.png/25px-Shar_Icon_Original.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Shar_Icon_Original.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Shar\" title=\"Shar\">Shar</a> to intervene, reducing all <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Scores\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Scores\">Ability Scores</a> by 1 until your next <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>. This reduction can stack up to 4 times.</dd></dl></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Mirrored\">Sources of Mirrored</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Affects the reflections created by the <a href=\"/wiki/Self-Same_Trial\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Self-Same Trial\">Self-Same Trial</a>.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200941\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.041 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.045 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 807/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 9892/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2699/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 16/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.019/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 988658/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   40.552      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   40.552      1 -total\n 45.24%   18.344      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 17.78%    7.208      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 16.19%    6.565      3 Template:Template_style\n 10.32%    4.186      4 Template:Main_namespace_only\n  8.88%    3.602      1 Template:PageSeo\n  8.56%    3.473      1 Template:Uid_style\n  4.68%    1.898      9 Template:Trim\n  3.48%    1.413      1 Template:NorbyteLink\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:31744-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714200941 and revision id 395213. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}